Package: chdp
Type: Package
Title: Covariate-dependent hierarchical Dirichlet process for cluster analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Author: person("Huizi", "Zhang", email = "H.Zhang-144@sms.ed.ac.uk",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Huizi Zhang <H.Zhang-144@sms.ed.ac.uk>
Description: This package implements the MCMC algorithm for covariate-dependent hierarchical 
    Dirichlet process to cluster observations across related groups. The C-HDP prior allows the incorporation
    of externel covariates through two types of kernel functions, namely a Gaussian kernel and a periodic kernel.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    bayNorm,
    mvtnorm,
    extraDistr,
    SciViews,
    Matrix,
    Rtsne,
    sets,
    truncnorm

